{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 20 classes to push, pull, grab, shoot, shove, slice, and explode your way to victory. Use the classes' unique abilities and nuances to control the puck and dominate your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gunner<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the Gunner has below average speed and power, it uses its bullet to supplement its mobility and force. With the lowest ability cool-down in the game it is able to use its bullet for a wide range of applications, like using the recoil for speed, shooting the other car to disrupt its movement, or just shooting the puck for a shot on goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Pillbug</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pillbug is the mascot of Hock. It makes up for its lack of an ability with its excellent power and shape. The Pillbug is able to power through just about every class and can use its rounded shape to hit extremely precise shots with the right player behind the controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Blimp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blimp is an extremely light and floaty class that can drop a massive wall into the arena. Since the blimp struggles to push or block classes on its own, it deploys its wall to help out. The usage of the wall greatly depends on the type of Blimp player. Many Blimp players opt for a more defensive strategy, using the wall to block any openings, while many others use it offensively, hurling it at their opponent and the puck like a projectile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, the gameplay and strategy of Hock greatly is decided by the player! With the wide range of classes and play styles, there is something for every type of person in Hock. What will you play?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342780?t=1760456560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342780?t=1760456560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/3b618702b7c5cb104744e8e5ef9a106ebca3dee6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760456560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/3b618702b7c5cb104744e8e5ef9a106ebca3dee6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760456560","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 20 classes to push, pull, grab, shoot, shove, slice, and explode your way to victory. Use the classes' unique abilities and nuances to control the puck and dominate your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gunner<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/c105e69852af517e5d4168c25ba5a914.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the Gunner has below average speed and power, it uses its bullet to supplement its mobility and force. With the lowest ability cool-down in the game it is able to use its bullet for a wide range of applications, like using the recoil for speed, shooting the other car to disrupt its movement, or just shooting the puck for a shot on goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Pillbug</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/ca91f041b4bc8ff9f911c06549d57031.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pillbug is the mascot of Hock. It makes up for its lack of an ability with its excellent power and shape. The Pillbug is able to power through just about every class and can use its rounded shape to hit extremely precise shots with the right player behind the controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Blimp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.poster.avif?t=1760456560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.webm?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/extras/6cda96cae76cfbdb5710f4221a8b8d53.mp4?t=1760456560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blimp is an extremely light and floaty class that can drop a massive wall into the arena. Since the blimp struggles to push or block classes on its own, it deploys its wall to help out. The usage of the wall greatly depends on the type of Blimp player. Many Blimp players opt for a more defensive strategy, using the wall to block any openings, while many others use it offensively, hurling it at their opponent and the puck like a projectile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, the gameplay and strategy of Hock greatly is decided by the player! With the wide range of classes and play styles, there is something for every type of person in Hock. What will you play?</p>","developers":["Ranzy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342780/header.jpg?t=1760456560","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3342780/1334350244/da5b35381275708f4e23138a52cb3ea2e21c2dd7/1758248575/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759097048","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3342780/1334350244/da5b35381275708f4e23138a52cb3ea2e21c2dd7/1758248575/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759097048","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3342780/1334350244/da5b35381275708f4e23138a52cb3ea2e21c2dd7/1758248575/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759097048","id":257201769,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201769/67a852be32e4f4755bae1c08eb9611fe03615752/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759097048"}],"name":"Hock","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeo